---
description: Keep route-local CSS local; global stylesheet order can break Feed, Chatroom, and Homepage
globs:
  - src/styles.css
  - src/styles/**/*.css
  - src/routes/__root.tsx
  - src/lib/app-surface-css.ts
  - src/components/app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# CSS safety

- Fix route-local UI in that route’s component or a colocated stylesheet. Do not “just tweak” global CSS.
- `src/styles.css` is guest-safe. `src/styles/app-surfaces.css` is for app surfaces (feed/chat/etc.).
- **Do not** load `app-surfaces.css` on guest homepage (`/`) unless the task explicitly requires it. `shouldLoadAppSurfaceStyles("/")` must stay `false`.
- Changing global utility order, `@source`, or Tailwind layers requires **desktop + mobile** smoke of `/`, `/feed`, and `/chatroom`.
- Prefer existing layout tests: `src/lib/desktop-app-layout.test.ts`, `src/lib/guest-home-bundle.test.ts`.
